{"name": "Harmony Strike", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5293880/extras/790743f5c6c10f04762c5a1da60f0dd2.poster.avif?t=1794505417\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5293880/extras/790743f5c6c10f04762c5a1da60f0dd2.webm?t=1794505417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5293880/extras/790743f5c6c10f04762c5a1da60f0dd2.mp4?t=1794505417\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beat a boss to rescue the hero it holds captive, then take them into your next fight.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Build your party from the heroes you rescue</li><li>Battle across different arenas, each with its own bosses and enemies</li><li>10 different elemental bonds between heroes who fight side by side</li><li>Shape every run with runes and relics</li><li>Weapons that evolve into new forms</li><li>Bring fallen heroes back to their feet</li><li>Climb the leaderboard in the endless Colosseum</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Fight in Harmony</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5293880/extras/71fddc216c2b858ae64c52c362d9e597.poster.avif?t=1794505417\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5293880/extras/71fddc216c2b858ae64c52c362d9e597.webm?t=1794505417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5293880/extras/71fddc216c2b858ae64c52c362d9e597.mp4?t=1794505417\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Put the right heroes side by side and Harmony sets the whole horde off at once.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Rescue heroes, build your party</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5293880/extras/8ac182c872902cf201c208112983797a.poster.avif?t=1794505417\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5293880/extras/8ac182c872902cf201c208112983797a.webm?t=1794505417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5293880/extras/8ac182c872902cf201c208112983797a.mp4?t=1794505417\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Bosses hold heroes captive. Beat one and that hero joins your party from the next run on.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Build your run</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5293880/extras/4b49deebef4ad3fba3fee6cc3a912921.poster.avif?t=1794505417\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5293880/extras/4b49deebef4ad3fba3fee6cc3a912921.webm?t=1794505417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5293880/extras/4b49deebef4ad3fba3fee6cc3a912921.mp4?t=1794505417\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick runes and relics as you fight, and push your weapons until they evolve into something new.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Between runs</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5293880/extras/a58eb685f1a2049908b1f32da05abfc5.poster.avif?t=1794505417\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5293880/extras/a58eb685f1a2049908b1f32da05abfc5.webm?t=1794505417\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5293880/extras/a58eb685f1a2049908b1f32da05abfc5.mp4?t=1794505417\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade weapons at the forge, invest in research, and choose which bonds your party forms.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "A party-based survivors-like where you lead a whole party of heroes instead of a single character. Each boss you defeat adds a new hero to your team, heroes fighting side by side combine their elements, and dozens of runes and relics shape every run.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5293880/7b96b9a7f4b4c8a3966d29aec094d8e4f49fcd9a/header.jpg?t=1794505417", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action Roguelike", "Bullet Heaven", "Bullet Hell", "Roguelite", "Dark Fantasy", "Pixel Graphics"], "developers": "Robin the Cat", "publishers": "Robin the Cat", "release_date": "Q1 2027", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "5293880", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "12 November 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/O3Qp8HhJI1g", "first_seen": 1794438000.0, "review_rank": 3}